# Installation

Clone the repository using an account with access, then install its dependencies:

```bash
git clone https://{{ repo_host_by_provider[repository_provider] }}/{{ repository_namespace }}/{{ repository_name }}.git
cd {{ repository_name }}
uv sync
```
